{{also|dar à luz}}
==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
{{lit|to give light}}, resulting from a {{glossary|reanalysis}} of the original expression ({{m|pt|dar à luz}}, literally, "to give to light"), which is {{glossary|homophonous}}.

===Verb===
{{pt-verb}}

# {{nonstandard form of|pt|dar à luz}}
#: {{ux|pt|Ela '''deu a luz''' a dois bebês: uma menina e um menino.|She '''gave birth''' to two babies: a girl and a boy.}}

